and file metadata are obtained from BioModels MODEL2004040001. BioModels
provides its encoded models and annotations under CC0 1.0 Public Domain
Dedication: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
Terms: https://www.biomodels.org/termsofuse
Retrieved bytes, URL, date and hashes are recorded in sources/retrievals.json.
inputs/biomodels-derived.bnet is generated from that SBML by the bundled
converter. Model-derived mathematical content in the verification artifacts
is checked against this CC0 source; original project contributions retain
the licenses stated above. These grants do not relicense other work.

The previously used frozen PyBoolNet bnet is not bundled; only its comparison
record remains. Its unresolved file-level terms are not assigned to the new
BioModels-derived file. The model redistribution hold is resolved by the
source replacement and complete local formula comparison. Public release
still requires the owner's decision.

The GINsim and PyBoolNet programs, BioModels service and cited papers are not
bundled. Their own terms apply. This package does not relicense them.
